  "bodyHash": "adc9888cc97b67d9",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7ff77b556f36b179d51d74b3cb8eadcfc148522.png\" alt=\"豐饒佳餚\"></p>\n<p><strong>《豐饒佳餚》在現有機制基礎上進行擴展，為 Minecraft 的飲食與農業系統增添簡潔的新內容，同時忠於原版遊戲體驗。</strong> 請注意，未來可能會新增或更改部分功能。</p>\n<h2>更新至 3.0.0 及以上版本請務必閱讀！</h2>\n<p>從 3.0.0 之前的版本更新到之後的版本，可能會導致你的世界出現以下問題：</p>\n<p><strong>棚架（Trellises）</strong> - 帶有植物的棚架方塊可能會消失。建議在更新前將上面的植物破壞掉。</p>\n<p><strong>茶葉拼配（Tea Blends）</strong> - 茶葉拼配物品已被移除，其功能已由製作它們的原材料直接取代。</p>\n<p><strong>卡士達醬（Custard）</strong> - 卡士達醬相關物品已被移除。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0418a9c6cba2880676b82f869e5098d41d578819.png\" alt=\"功能特色\"></p>\n<h4>- 果樹 - 產出蘋果、柳橙、檸檬、李子與椰子</h4>\n<h4>- 野生作物與新作物種類 - 例如百香果、韭菜與海綿果</h4>\n<h4>- 棚架 - 用於裝飾或種植藤蔓類作物</h4>\n<h4>- 嗅探獸出土的古植物 - 霜白蘋果樹與青金石莓</h4>\n<h4>- 陶瓷方塊 - 可染成任意顏色</h4>\n<h4>- 全新食物效果 - 為飲食系統增添更多策略性</h4>\n<h4>- 發酵系統 - 解鎖蜂蜜酒、蘋果西打等新食譜</h4>\n<h4>- 大量新增的食物物品與方塊</h4>\n<h4>- 全新畫作 - 展示模組相關內容</h4>\n<h3><strong>如需了解各項功能的詳細運作方式，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Heccology/Bountiful-Fares/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a>。</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7083d0b815d527fb670ba807c3c4f793662463c7.png\" alt=\"常見問題\"></p>\n<h3>這是《農夫樂事（Farmer's Delight）》的附加模組嗎？</h3>\n<p>不是，這是一款獨立模組。</p>\n<h3>會有基岩版（Bedrock）嗎？／我可以將其移植到基岩版嗎？</h3>\n<p>不會。請不要期待任何與基岩版相關的內容，也請勿自行移植。</p>\n<h3>會移植到 [填入舊版號] 嗎？／我可以將其移植到 [填入舊版號] 嗎？</h3>\n<p>不會。部分功能需要最新版本支援，也請勿自行移植。</p>\n<h3>《豐饒佳餚》將會更新到哪些版本？</h3>\n<p>目前僅會持續更新 1.20.1 與 1.21.1 版本，較新版本獲得移植的機率極低。</p>\n<h3>我可以在整合包、伺服器或其他內容中使用《豐饒佳餚》嗎？</h3>\n<p>當然可以！</p>\n<h3>我可以將《豐饒佳餚》的模型／材質用於其他專案嗎？</h3>\n<p>不行。請不要將其任何模型或材質用於其他用途，即使標明出處也不行。（請查看 GitHub 上的授權條款）</p>\n<h3>我可以將《豐饒佳餚》的資源用於製作附加模組嗎？</h3>\n<p>簡單來說，可以！但請務必確認 GitHub 上的授權條款。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3749759aeac0f5ad6575851811e34cdef9753eb9.png\" alt=\"相容性\"></p>\n<h3>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a></h3>\n<h3>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252famendments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amendments</a></h3>\n<h3>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fartsandcrafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Art's and Crafts</a></h3>\n<h3>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappledog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appledog</a></h3>\n<h3>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fno-mans-land\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Man's Land</a></h3>\n<h3>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffrontiers-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frontiers</a></h3>\n<h3>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd55de2e774138e905357e79e537782ffa8e1cd2.png\" alt=\"致謝名單\"></p>\n<p>材質協助 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252ftellioaridoitsu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Tellioaridoitsu</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fothergoblin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Othergoblin</a></p>\n<p>程式碼協助 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fyirmiri.zeus.kitchen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Yirmiri</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fkekecreations.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@KekeCreations</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fartyrian.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Artyrian</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fDiemond_Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Diemond_Player</a></p>\n<h2>翻譯支援 - 內容可能偶爾過時</h2>\n<p>西班牙語翻譯：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/ArBeeeet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Arbeeeet</a></p>\n<p>法語與加拿大法語翻譯：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Raeigor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Raeigor</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/wool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@wool</a><em>_</em> 以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/chil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@chil</a>_achilles</p>\n<p>簡體中文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/Junnaturefox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Jun_naturefox</a></p>\n<p>瑞典語翻譯：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/olilllin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Olilllin</a></p>\n<p>波蘭語翻譯：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fkemiuarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@kemiuarts</a></p>\n<p>日語翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/RolfoRobot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@RolfoRobot</a></p>\n<p>俄語翻譯：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fDiemond_Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Diemond_Player</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/36cf97f8f72aa922ede33497f05fcc15f1079e13.png\" alt=\"其他專案\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fheccolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f8bf4fcef2b25ec0fe2e7e2ebf23785d9bc8267.png\" alt=\"HeccoLib\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappledog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ca7b844afe710794076d650c54fc0b16f9846da_0.webp\" alt=\"appledog!\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ac51ec56b18549c94f20973ac5c8d520a5bfbc0d.png\" alt=\"聯絡資訊\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fyrDsSeNkWu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/580b5f7f4f2d41ff0f6ee3e06caead00a6747e5d.png\" alt=\"Discord 圖示\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fhecco.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/439d1bf0de9cb55be3270cc1e1e2aa6149f9598e.png\" alt=\"Bluesky 圖示\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fHecco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a5b793cfc096e5677e0828de3aad077c729c8bc1.png\" alt=\"Twitter / X 圖示\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fhecco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa2ff27fa029d3462e365929eef8f4f9e1f69405.png\" alt=\"Kofi 圖示\"></a></p>\n<p>您可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Heccology/Bountiful-Fares/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或我的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/yrDsSeNkWu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報錯誤。</p>",
